---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Confirm from '../components/Confirm.astro';
import product from '../data/product.json';
import { dollars } from '../lib/money.js';

const email = product.contactEmail;
---

<Layout title="Terms" description="The terms that apply when you use this site or order a shirt.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p class="lede">Plain-English rules for using this site and buying a shirt.</p>
      <p>
        <Confirm /> This is starter text. Have someone qualified look it over before launch, and fill in who operates
        the shop.
      </p>
      <p>Last updated October 10, 2026. <Confirm /></p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This Is Our Year is an independent apparel brand based in New York, NY. <Confirm /> It is not affiliated with,
        licensed by, or endorsed by any professional football league or team. Our shirts use city names and colors.
        They don't use any league or team names, logos, or other marks.
      </p>

      <h2>Ordering</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Shirts start at {dollars(product.priceCents)}. Prices are in US dollars and are shown before you pay. Shipping
          and any sales tax are added at checkout.
        </li>
        <li>Payment is handled by Stripe. Your order is placed when your payment goes through.</li>
        <li>
          We can cancel and refund an order if something's off, like a pricing mistake or a problem with the payment.
        </li>
        <li>You need to be 18 or older to order, or have a parent or guardian's permission.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Made to order</h2>
      <p>
        Every shirt is printed after you order it. Colors on your screen are a close guide, not an exact match, and the
        shirt in the picture is an illustration. The real one can vary slightly in shade and print placement.
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping and returns</h2>
      <p>
        These are covered on the <a href="/shipping-returns/">shipping and returns</a> page, which is part of these
        terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Using this site</h2>
      <p>
        The design, artwork, and text on this site belong to This Is Our Year. Please don't copy them or use them to
        sell your own products. Don't misuse the site, try to break it, or use it for anything illegal.
      </p>

      <h2>The legal part</h2>
      <p>
        The site and our products are provided as is. To the extent the law allows, our liability for any order is
        limited to what you paid for it. Nothing here limits rights you have that can't be waived under the law where
        you live. These terms are governed by the laws of the State of New York. <Confirm />
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If these terms change, the new version goes on this page with a new date at the top.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. <Confirm /></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
